      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've noticed this also happens when there aren't a lot of users in an instance as well, I was playing in a world one-on-one with my friend and VRChat refused to load their avatar. My Quest 2 didn't have problems in VRChat like this before. The loading bar that shows download status reads \"too many avatars,\" despite it being a one-on-one instance. Clearing some memory in the debug menu seemed to help a small amount, but the bug still happens. During the same update, my friend who plays with a Vive XR started getting crashes often whenever loading a new instance as well, perhaps its VRChat's memory system that changed causing both of us to have problems?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
